    <description>Record-Triggered Flow:
- Flow is triggered when Project record is created or updated

UPDATE:
W-002549 - The &quot;MS Assignment&quot; record &quot;End Date&quot; fields are updated when the &quot;MS Project&quot; record&apos;s &quot;End Date&quot; field is updated.
Case#00016258 - Found that logic in Previous story was duplicative and we just needed to update some existing logic to automatically update all Active Assignments when the resource is W2, Project is MS, or the Project End Date is moved to sooner.
W-002574 - Moved Automation from Project: After Trigger flow as the had the same trigger.
W-002574 - Added automation for Checklist Process.
2/20/26 - Process Builder Migration - Added update of Account Last Project Close date and reorganized flow to have changes only run under update paths.</description>
